sader, charitable heroes. My understanding is that one of them found the book in their child's room and brought it along asking for advice on what to do about it!<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I really like reading stories about people making games their own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T19:20:34-07:00","id":222681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=219941#post219941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Interestingly I know of an apocryphal tale of a bible study group in my home town that met up in the back of a church on weekends who played Demon the Fallen with all of them being Reconcilers. They were essentially playing with the 'God has unlimited forgiveness' as the driving force, they just had to go out and <i>earn</i> it by being what amounted to Christian misionary crusader, charitable heroes. My understanding is that one of them found the book in their child's room and brought it along asking for advice on what to do about it!<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That wasn't Toledo, by any chance, was it? Because I know my brother played DtF in a church.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T00:30:14-07:00","id":222923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=222681#post222681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That wasn't Toledo, by any chance, was it? Because I know my brother played DtF in a church.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, no Exeter. In the UK.<br /> <br /> Did something similar happen in Toledo?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T19:20:47-07:00","id":224771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=222923#post222923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, no Exeter. In the UK.<br /> <br /> Did something similar happen in Toledo?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Only isofar as my brother's group was playing <b>Demon</b> in a church basement or back room or something, which I thought was kind of funny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T08:11:39-07:00","id":225090,"title":"","content":"Question: how would the Maeljin come into play? Would they be Earthbound, archdemons, or stay as Infernal Incarna (in the eyes of the Fallen)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T21:31:39-07:00","id":225632,"title":"","content":"...I'm not even sure how the Unchained would see them. Probably just powerful spirits. Sort of how the Fallen see the Wyrm maybe? Just smaller.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T06:26:20-07:00","id":280931,"title":"","content":"2 month later... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> So, any chance to see the DTG in 2014? Or will it be a next years project?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4084-michaelsd","name":"MichaelSD","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T23:31:47-07:00","id":281999,"title":"","content":"It will probably wait for next year, and I'm cool with that. Still eager for it, don't get me wrong...<br /> <br /> But I'm hoping they don't try to fit it all in the 60 page count originally listed. If I have to wait another 6 months to get a book big enough to fit the translations of all the corebook splat powers, I'll be happy. Between Lores and Embeds alone, it would gobble up 40-50 pages at least. That is leaving out Exploits, Torment, Gadgets, Rituals, Form Powers and Thralls. Assuming Pacts work about the the same anyway...<br /> <br /> Edit: Forgot about Cover, definetly need Cover in there. And yes, this excludes translating antagonists like Angels, Cryptids and Earthbound.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 10-15-2014, 02:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T23:41:21-07:00","id":282001,"title":"","content":"That's assuming they don't just convert the basics, clarify on particular edge cases, and let players do the rest.<br /> <br /> Which they've historically done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T02:32:50-07:00","id":282102,"title":"","content":"The basics being an overview and guidelines on how to adapt Lores, Embeds and Exploits. But I seem to remember Rose saying that Cover and Torment would both be done as well. Which still feels like more than 60 pages.<br /> <br /> Point it is, it has the potential to be awesome, the authors have a good track record and Onyx Path likes to do things right rather than fast. It is been worth the wait to date. So until I am horribly disappointed with the product in front of me, I'm going to trust them to do it right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T17:35:23-07:00","id":282952,"title":"","content":"I sincerely hope it will include a Demon the Fallen conversion for the GMC rules. To be honest, putting the two kind of demons in different in each other's setting does not make much sense. They are so different in every conceivable way,,,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4084-michaelsd","name":"MichaelSD","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T17:55:02-07:00","id":282966,"title":"","content":"It's a translation guide, of course it goes both ways. *rolls eyes at old problems*<br /> <br /> Disregarding that, it's debatable, actually. Parallel dimensions very well fits into some of the sci-fi take that Descent takes, and certain points of Fallen, like the Fiend's discussions about the celestial engines of time, could create a precendent for the God-Machine being the tool of God. The two could invade each other quite well....<br /> <br /> ..., alright, especially if you factor Inferno into the idea. It doesn't need to appear in the Translation Guide, but some careful application of Inferno alongside the Guide helps to smooth the transition.<br /> <br /> PS: Seriously guys, I know you have your opinions, and I respect that, but the sheer amount of .....hurt over Descent is making me start to hate Fallen-and my favorite character ever is from Fallen, so consider that.<br /> <br /> The disdain is starting to feel poisonous, is all I'm saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T19:16:52-07:00","id":283085,"title":"","content":"I absolutely agree with you on that ArcaneArts. It'd be nice if everyone could just try to appreciate them for what they are. Crossover games aren't high on the priority list of to play for me or my group. The fanboy in me insists on trying though","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T21:26:03-07:00","id":283211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=282966#post282966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a translation guide, of course it goes both ways. *rolls eyes at old problems*<br /> <br /> Disregarding that, it's debatable, actually. Parallel dimensions very well fits into some of the sci-fi take that Descent takes, and certain points of Fallen, like the Fiend's discussions about the celestial engines of time, could create a precendent for the God-Machine being the tool of God. The two could invade each other quite well....<br /> <br /> ..., alright, especially if you factor Inferno into the idea. It doesn't need to appear in the Translation Guide, but some careful application of Inferno alongside the Guide helps to smooth the transition.<br /> <br /> PS: Seriously guys, I know you have your opinions, and I respect that, but the sheer amount of .....hurt over Descent is making me start to hate Fallen-and my favorite character ever is from Fallen, so consider that.<br /> <br /> The disdain is starting to feel poisonous, is all I'm saying.</div> </div> </div> </div>No offense, but is the distain showing up in other threads? Because I\u2019m not seeing it here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T22:03:39-07:00","id":283242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=283211#post283211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No offense, but is the distain showing up in other threads? Because I\u2019m not seeing it here.</div> </div> </div> </div>The ellipses are markers of some <i>extremely annoying arguments</i> Arc is alluding to vis-a-vis the matter of What Is And Is Not A Proper Demon.<br /> <br /> That a non-negligible proportion of the people looking forward to the Translation Guide appear to be unable to express their anticipation without bringing up their dislike of Descent is one of those things that gets very old very fast.<br /> <br /> Certain individuals' repeated pushing for making Descent a lot more like Inferno likewise means Arc's background contributes a certain degree of reluctance to mention it as a potential facilitator of easy translation - the accession would not be so easily rendered begrudging if not for the precedent that produced Arc previously remarking on multiple occasions how annoying it was that Inferno kept being brought up.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, this is the approximate limit of how much forum-historic metaconversation I feel comfortable engaging in on a weeknight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T03:29:19-07:00","id":283659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=282966#post282966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a translation guide, of course it goes both ways. *rolls eyes at old problems*<br /> <br /> PS: Seriously guys, I know you have your opinions, and I respect that, but the sheer amount of .....hurt over Descent is making me start to hate Fallen-and my favorite character ever is from Fallen, so consider that.<br /> <br /> The disdain is starting to feel poisonous, is all I'm saying.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. First it is not &quot;of course it goes both ways&quot;. The TGs were good, but not exceptional, especially the part of playing old setting with new rules. Nowhere is the pre-GMC setting so different than with Demon (and it does not matter, if it is for good or bad). So, yes, reading through the past TGs, I have my doubts. What may be enough for two similar settings won't be enough in case of Demon.<br /> <br /> 2. Some people, and I am not alone with that, supported DtD to have a DTG to play DTF with GMC rules. If this consist disdain in your eyes, the problem is in your system. The DtD vs. DtF problem has been discussed to death, so you should know by know that many people imagine Demon differently. Live with it.<br /> <br /> 3. In my opinion there are more people, or to quote Satchel: there is a &quot;non-negligible proportion of the people&quot; who want to play DtF with GMC rules, than the those who want to play Demons and Machine Spirits (&lt;- this is a hint of disdain <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) along each other.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I know what I have to know. Thank you for everyone for the information and input.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4084-michaelsd","name":"MichaelSD","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T08:21:42-07:00","id":283864,"title":"","content":"1)Your doubts are your own issues. The idea of the Guides has always been allow stuff to go both ways, and this one seems to even allow for more complete hybrids(SO AWEOME!*insert scrunchy face*). I've had some reasonable success on both fronts. I know others have not.<br /> <br /> 2)I know, I know, I'm just complaining. I'm taking a minute to be juvenille, because when you get right down, you people aren't doing anything to me, you're just expressing your strong opinions.<br /> <br /> 3)...although if you're going to blatantly admit to some disdain, then I'm not sure why you're calling me out on that particular point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T08:30:49-07:00","id":283876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=283242#post283242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The ellipses are markers of some <i>extremely annoying arguments</i> Arc is alluding to vis-a-vis the matter of What Is And Is Not A Proper Demon.<br /> <br /> That a non-negligible proportion of the people looking forward to the Translation Guide appear to be unable to express their anticipation without bringing up their dislike of Descent is one of those things that gets very old very fast.<br /> <br /> Certain individuals' repeated pushing for making Descent a lot more like Inferno likewise means Arc's background contributes a certain degree of reluctance to mention it as a potential facilitator of easy translation - the accession would not be so easily rendered begrudging if not for the precedent that produced Arc previously remarking on multiple occasions how annoying it was that Inferno kept being brought up.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, this is the approximate limit of how much forum-historic metaconversation I feel comfortable engaging in on a weeknight.</div> </div> </div> </div>THanks Satchel.<br /> <br /> Putting a a too long,didn't read take on this, the number of times I've wanted to write essays either titled &quot;Why Descent is Totally About Angels As You Know Them&quot; or &quot;Why It Doesn't Matter That They Aren't Angels As You Know Them&quot;(yes, both are complete and seperate essays I have outlined that chew more or less into the same subject matter, just from different angles) exceed the number of digits I have by a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T11:22:16-07:00","id":283984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MichaelSD</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=283659#post283659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1. First it is not &quot;of course it goes both ways&quot;. The TGs were good, but not exceptional, especially the part of playing old setting with new rules. Nowhere is the pre-GMC setting so different than with Demon (and it does not matter, if it is for good or bad). So, yes, reading through the past TGs, I have my doubts. What may be enough for two similar settings won't be enough in case of Demon.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd beg the differ. <b>Changeling</b> is probably just as different, maybe <i>very</i> slightly more, <b>Mummy</b> is more different. Honestly <b>Geist</b> has more in common with<b> Mummy: The Resurrectio</b>n than <b>Mummy: The Curse</b>.<br /> <br /> Not that it is a good or bad thing, as you say.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3. In my opinion there are more people, or to quote Satchel: there is a &quot;non-negligible proportion of the people&quot; who want to play DtF with GMC rules, than the those who want to play Demons and Machine Spirits (&lt;- this is a hint of disdain <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> ) along each other. </div> </div> </div>I am somewhat skeptical about the more people. I am not one to edition war and like both games; threads like this make me want to distance myself from DtF, however.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T14:52:14-07:00","id":284241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MichaelSD</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=283659#post283659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. In my opinion there are more people, or to quote Satchel: there is a &quot;non-negligible proportion of the people&quot; who want to play DtF with GMC rules</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay:<br /> <br /> <b>a)</b> &quot;Three people who won't shut up&quot; is sufficient for the constituency of these forums to qualify as &quot;a non-negligible proportion&quot; and my intent in framing the count as such was to underline the fact that no, it's rather harder to politely ignore those people than it is for those people to refrain from directly violating the very definition of the &quot;don't like, don't read&quot; clause or, say, talk about the Translation Guide in the DtF forums where you're not <i>actively going into the thing's metaphorical house and talking shit about its metaphorical d\u00e9cor in front of its metaphorical friends.</i><br /> <br /> <b>b)</b> As has been pointed out, doing the shit I am highlighting has been historically contentious as concerns this game is in fact, on its most politely-worded face, pointless edition-warring. <i>The game is overtly not presented as &quot;DtF in the nWoD,&quot; expecting it to be such in spite of nearly a year of pre-release discussion and the book establishing it is flagrantly myopic, and complaining about the game not being nFallen or fullgame-Inferno <b>in the place where people come to discuss the actual game whose title is on the cover</b> is near the height of shenanigans.</i><br /> <br /> In <b>c)</b>onclusion, No, you don't get to quotemine my admonition into a mock-cited silent majority claim in an argument where your starting supposition (implicit in your &quot;I hope they do this&quot; structuring) is that a Translation Guide <i>will not actually function as a guide for translation of the games it connects.</i> Do not do this again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 10-16-2014, 05:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T17:16:30-07:00","id":284355,"title":"","content":"FWIW: if there\u2019s anywhere in the DtD forum where it would be acceptable to state a preference for DtF over DtD, it would be in a thread discussing the Translation Guide. It\u2019s not what I <i>personally</i> prefer to do (I view DtF and DtD as separate games, each with its own charm), and I\u2019m not at all sympathetic with anything to the effect of \u201cFallen is better than Descent!\u201d anywhere else on the DtD forum; and IMHO, the proper venue for voicing such an opinion would be the cWoD forum (which is <i>also</i> a suitable place for discussion of the DTG); but I can\u2019t condemn someone for expressing such an opinion in a thread such as this one. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m a fan of DtF, and I look forward to getting rules for using the Houses, Factions, Faith, and Lores in the nWoD \u2014 though I personally feel that many (not all!) such things would translate more smoothly to the Possessed from the Inferno than to the Unchained. Heck, I wouldn\u2019t mind a translation of <b>Inferno</b>\u2019s Vestments or something like its Infernal Will for use in DtF. <i>Not</i> DtD; I\u2019m quite happy with DtD and Inferno being two distinct things, and prefer them to be clearly different. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m also a fan of DtD; and I <i>also</i> look forward to getting rules for incorporating the likes of Incarnations, Covers, Embeds, and Exploits into DtF. I especially like the fact that the Unchained are inversions of the traditional view of demons: arguably heroic figures fighting a covert war against a dictatorial power; and I like the notion of reframing DtF in a similar way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-17T14:16:28-07:00","id":285364,"title":"","content":"So what can I suspect about the TG I've never purchased one before. I don't really care for owod or dtf since. I love to support demon so I may buy the book just because its a supplement fur the descent. But would it have anything that adds to the general concept or themes behind dtd? As I've said I've got not experience with translation guides.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-17T17:03:24-07:00","id":285506,"title":"","content":"The single biggest value of a Translation Gude for those who aren\u2019t familiar with (or interested in) one of the games involved is that it provides clarification by comparing and contrasting the two games. As well, you can treat it as a sort of \u201cWorld of Darkness: Mirrors\u201d, giving you hacks that let you change what your version of DtD is like. That those hacks were inspired by DtF is largely irrelevant, save only for the fact that they will all be compatible with each other. <br /> <br /> (It goes without saying that over half of the book will be of no use to you; but I\u2019ve bought books for the sake of a far smaller portion.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T11:27:35-07:00","id":286044,"title":"","content":"The Translation Guide will translate elements of each game to the other. That means that in either case you can use it (in conjunction with the other core book) as a resource for powers, and stuff like Cover or Torment is applicable to either line. It's meant to help you take samples from each game and create a unique mix for your chronicle.<br /> <br /> If you wholly dislike either game, it's probably not what you're looking for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 10-18-2014, 06:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T15:45:55-07:00","id":286232,"title":"","content":"My good, so many uptight people.<br /> <br /> Thank you for the answer Rose Bailey, you answered my question precisely, thank you. And yes, it is not what I am looking for....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4084-michaelsd","name":"MichaelSD","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T16:02:11-07:00","id":286237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Putting a a too long,didn't read take on this, the number of times I've wanted to write essays either titled &quot;Why Descent is Totally About Angels As You Know Them&quot; or &quot;Why It Doesn't Matter That They Aren't Angels As You Know Them&quot;(yes, both are COMPLETE and seperate essays I have outlined that chew more or less into the same subject matter, just from different angles) exceed the number of digits I have by a lot. </div> </div> </div>And for me neither former Angels of Fallen and Descent have anything to do with my favorite brand mythical Angels, as Angels of Judaism cannot Fall. Satan is still an Angel who is YHWH's &quot;chief prosecutor (along with Belial, Mastema and other Adversary Angels). But that does not mean ofc I reject Descent ones, though I find Fallen incongruous with my view on Abrahamic god. I simply just added another 'type' of 'Angels' that serve a Celestine whose one of masks is Abrahamic God.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T16:09:17-07:00","id":286241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MichaelSD</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=286232#post286232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My good, so many uptight people.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's like you went and kicked their puppy or something. In their own house.<br /> <br /> *cough*<br /> <br /> Sorry that the DTG isn't going to help you.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T16:22:42-07:00","id":286247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's like you went and kicked their puppy or something. In their own house. </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/RB6TS2Y.png?1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Ultimate evil.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses I