a few ideas, but I need to play around with the sheets a bit...<br /> <br /> <br /> Still need to get my hands on the new hybrid border though....</div> </div> </div> </div>I was strongly thinking about buying an extra copy for you, but sadly, money is in even more of a crunch than it usually is for me right now if I want to survive this goddamn heat. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T09:55:25-07:00","id":621425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=615313#post615313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quality before immediacy, good sir. We shall await your genius with up-most patience. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well thank you! I appreciate that! Just hope I can pull something off. I have a couple of ideas, just need to see if they'll work or not...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=616790#post616790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was strongly thinking about buying an extra copy for you, but sadly, money is in even more of a crunch than it usually is for me right now if I want to survive this goddamn heat. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thats ok! It's nice you'd even think about that. But I wouldn't want you to buy one for me. If it comes down to it, I'll buy on myself. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Anyway, surviving the head is way more important. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T17:36:14-07:00","id":621751,"title":"","content":"So...think one of you kind souls could give me a brief overview about what you can mix and match between the two Demon games? It's my understanding you can kind of mix and match systems, but I'm just wondering what the extent of that is. If that question even makes sense...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T19:13:16-07:00","id":621793,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Tolerance and Fuel:</span></b><br /> The character can either have 1 to 10 dots of (permanent) <b>Faith or Primum.</b><br /> The character can either have a track of 10 (temporary) <b>Faith</b> boxes, or the standard nWoD fuel box panoply of <b>Aether.</b><br /> These are treated as <b>mutually exclusive;</b> mechanics either refer to Faith or Primum/Aether, but not both.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Integrity:</span></b><br /> The character can have a <b>Torment track,</b> which is treated in the Storytelling System pretty much as Integrity. It's a ten-dot track that can be read either way horizontally. Reading filled dots from the left tallies Integrity, while reading open dots from the right tallies Torment. So, for example, \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cb\u25cb\u25cb\u25cb indicates Integrity 6 and Torment 4.<br /> The character can have <b>Cover ratings,</b> which are a separate ten-dot track for every Cover possessed, up to a maximum number of Covers equal to Primum (or, presumably, permanent Faith).<br /> These systems <b>work in parallel</b> and don't interfere with one another, so while the Translation Guide generally expects you to track either Torment or Cover, it is possible to have both simultaneously.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Infernal Ranks:</span></b><br /> The character can be classified by a <b>House and a Faction</b> or an <b>Incarnation and an Agenda</b>.<br /> In both cases, the former axis determines associated powers (favored Lores or Embeds). However, while straightforward Unchained have an ongoing Condition bestowed by their Agenda, the same mechanic used for Fallen in the Storytelling System derives from their House, not their Faction.<br /> Therefore, these should probably be treated as <b>mutually exclusive.</b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Magic Wizard Spells:</span></b><br /> The character may use the system for <b>Lores</b> or for <b>Embeds and Exploits</b> to import powers from one game into the other.<br /> The character may also use <b>a hybrid system</b> which assembles Embeds, Exploits and Interlocks into a five-dot progression to produce custom Lores (with the first, second and fourth evocations of the Lore being Key Embeds, the third evocation being an Interlock and the fifth an Exploit). In this hybrid system, a single Embed can even occupy space as a Key in multiple Lores, at the same or differing dot levels.<br /> Original recipe Lores can also <b>coexist with either</b> these hybrid Lores or with classic Embeds and Exploits. Hybrid Lores do not seem designed to coexist with classic Embeds and Exploits, however.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This Isn't Even My Final Form:</span></b><br /> The character may either have an <b>apocalyptic form</b> with four normal abilities and four Torment abilities, or a <b>demonic form</b> with three Modifications, two Technologies, one Propulsion, and one Process, developing more abilities as Primum advances or with certain Merits.<br /> These choices are <b>mutually exclusive,</b> and as apocalyptic forms have Torment abilities, apocalyptic forms can't be used as-is without a Torment track. Powers of one type are converted for use in the other type, however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T04:22:39-07:00","id":622050,"title":"","content":"Thanks!! That'll help me out a lot! I appreciate it! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id