 see why not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-04T18:42:55-08:00","id":1272916,"title":"","content":"Hmm, the forum won't accept the file. Is there a place I could post it where people who need it could find it easily?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T10:59:03-08:00","id":1273603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=12OtaeWDqxrwCZoijqmJ8hVh8MNGUVMER\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=12OtaeWDqxrwCZoijqmJ8hVh8MNGUVMER\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=12OtaeWDqxrwCZoijqmJ8hVh8MNGUVMER\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=12OtaeWDqxrwCZoijqmJ8hVh8MNGUVMER </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> Here's a direct link to the file, maybe this'll work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T13:08:41-08:00","id":1273619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr. Stitch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=1273603#post1273603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=12OtaeWDqxrwCZoijqmJ8hVh8MNGUVMER\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=12O...J8hVh8MNGUVMER</a><br /> <br /> Here's a direct link to the file, maybe this'll work.</div> </div> </div> </div>On following the link I found a (very nice) Demon: The Fallen character sheet. Is this what you meant by a &quot;translation guide?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T13:21:38-08:00","id":1273621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr. Stitch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=1272779#post1272779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually managed to make a decent Translation Guide <b>sheet</b> myself. It's just the Descent sheet hacked up and re-formatted with some new text, but it gets the job done. Is this a good place to post it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Bolded for emphasis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T17:38:44-08:00","id":1273813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bael the Cruel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=807524#post807524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So i've been scouring the forums and the interwebs. What ever happened to the character sheet for this?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=807530#post807530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No idea. Sort of just fell silent...</div> </div> </div> </div>I am sooooo sorry. I could have sworn I posted about it here.<br /> <br /> Back when I was trying to work on this it just started to seem impossible. There seemed to be no set way of translating things, and you could mix and match systems from the various games. I couldn't think of a way to make a sheet that would let the user mix and match in that way. I'd basically have to make a sheet for every permeation of the systems... At least that's how it seemed to me. So, I just kind of abandoned it. It didn't seem as straight forward as the other translations guides, where I could basically make a sheet for each game, and then mix up the aesthetic. I mean, I could have done that for this, but that's not really how the translation worked, since Demon the Descent and Demon the Fallen are essentially two different types of beings.<br /> <br /> If y'all have some new thoughts on how a sheet for this might be, I'd be willing to revisit it...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr. Stitch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=1272779#post1272779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually managed to make a decent Translation Guide sheet myself. It's just the Descent sheet hacked up and re-formatted with some new text, but it gets the job done. Is this a good place to post it?</div> </div> </div> </div>So, this is a sheet for Demon the Fallen made using the Translation Guide?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T19:20:14-08:00","id":1273824,"title":"","content":"The demon translation guide was the only book I disliked enough to ask for a refund from Drivethrurpg (the only other refund requested was because I bought two Wayfarers Guide to Eberron instead of one). <br /> <br /> Others might like it, I'm not trying to be hater, just giving my two cents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T19:26:23-08:00","id":1273825,"title":"","content":"Gone: Yeah it is, though it's kind of unfinished. It needs a row of boxes for Torment Points.<br /> <br /> I'm working on a full-and-proper rules conversion in my spare time, and making two sets of rules so that the game can be played via 1st or 2nd Edition NWoD/CoD rules.<br /> <br /> From what I've seen, if you're not a fan of Condtions, Tilts, Breaking Points, and other 2nd ed stuff, then using Torment Points is the best method for playing with 1st Ed NWoD rules.<br /> <br /> <br /> Omegaphallic: I know how you feel dude, I was PISSED when that thing dropped. It's a mess, and hardly covers the basics of what you need to run Fallen in NWoD/CoD. That's why I'm working on the rules conversions, cause those of us who want a cleaner, streamlined version of Fallen deserve something that's functional.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T17:02:17-08:00","id":1273970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=1273824#post1273824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The demon translation guide was the only book I disliked enough to ask for a refund from Drivethrurpg (the only other refund requested was because I bought two Wayfarers Guide to Eberron instead of one).<br /> <br /> Others might like it, I'm not trying to be hater, just giving my two cents.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh wow...sorry to hear that. I never read it mind you, but still. Sorry...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr. Stitch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=1273825#post1273825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gone: Yeah it is, though it's kind of unfinished. It needs a row of boxes for Torment Points.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, well that's cool. You did a pretty job with it all things considered. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T19:35:51-08:00","id":1273983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=1273970#post1273970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, well that's cool. You did a pretty job with it all things considered. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Why thank you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T21:33:12-08:00","id":1273994,"title":"","content":"Once DtF and DtD are in the Storyteller's Vault, it might be a good idea for some entrepreneur with knowledge of both to publish a Translation Guide Supplemental. I know I'd like to publish one dedicated specifically to matters involving DtD vs. Inferno (which, frankly, is at least as good a fit as DtF vs. DtD); but there's definitely more that could have been done with the official Translation Guide with respect to the latter comparison as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 12-29-2018, 01:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-28T22:56:11-08:00","id":1277308,"title":"","content":"UPDATE: I've added my rules conversions to the G-Drive, including the system-specific rules (harvesting faith, thralls, revelation, etc.), updated demonic Lores, and an updated Apocalyptic Form creation system. I also want to implement a power balancing system to the Fallen template, something like how Changelings gain Frailties or Unchained gain Glitches. I'm thinking of calling them &quot;Marks of the Beast&quot; or &quot;Marks&quot; for short; they start as minor things (hair/eye color changes, the faint smell of smoke or sea-breeze) then graduate to obvious physical changes at the highest levels of Faith (horns, a tail, weird body shape, glowing veins). Any input on this would be much appreciated.<br /> <br /> Here's the link to the folder: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=15rooWYO_cWT1u0APYeD507S2Pc3ETZ1y\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=15r...D507S2Pc3ETZ1y</a> <br /> <br /> In addition, anyone think it'd be worth trying to mock up a NWoD conversion for the Earthbound rules? I only just found out their supplement lets you make them PCs and I think that'd be fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-28T22:58:02-08:00","id":1277309,"title":"","content":"P.S. Understand that the Lores and Form creation are still works-in-progress, especially the former. Any input you all could offer for tweaks and balances is welcome and appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T19:45:20-08:00","id":1277435,"title":"","content":"I haven't finished reading through but the part where none of the examples have been updated for the rules you are testing out is bugging me. Like an itch in my brain.<br /> <br /> Will be back later with more ideas; would also like to check your feelings on the official Translation guide. Admittedly it lacks the details on the Lores and various subsystems, but it can help highlight which parts need to be reworked and which parts you wish to deviate from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T21:53:40-08:00","id":1277450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198652-demon-translation-guide?p=1277435#post1277435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven't finished reading through but the part where none of the examples have been updated for the rules you are testing out is bugging me. Like an itch in my brain.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cheers mate, I totally spaced on those, I'll fix them ASAP.<br /> <br /> As for the TG itself, like you said it's got some good ideas, and it's a great springboard to jump from, but the fact that it's missing those critical components and completely botched the Apocalyptic Form conversion mean that a framework is all it can really be. Just my opinion.<br /> <br /> Though I was amused that the &quot;God-Machine is an outside invader that both Fallen and Unchained can fight&quot; is an official plot hook, cause I came up with that on my own after the translation guide was announced","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T22:04:27-08:00","id":1277452,"title":"","content":"Penny for your thoughts: In editing the aforementioned examples, I'm wondering if the 'Freebie Points' system shouldn't be kept in-game. XP grants in NWoD can't really beef up a character the same way FPs can in OWoD. Should I just keep the FP system or could it break the game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24665-mr-stitch","name":"Mr. Stitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24665_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T23:01:45-08:00","id":1277458,"title":"","content":"In that particular that example was the most caring but all of them seem to use the OWoD system.<br /> <br /> But as far as the freebie points go; the hard cap of what the demon has basically prevents ridiculous growth, so the change to the experience point system is less bad than it intially seems. For example those 10 freebies spent on two attributes (1 Stamina &amp; 1 Dexterity) would be reconfigured to 15 XP which is actually worth 3 attributes (5 a piece). Which is the opposite problem compared what you were suggesting.<br /> The Chronicles update switched the experience system to flat costs and each experience point is comparable to five of the old nWoD experience (beats are similar).<br /> <br /> So the change shouldn't break the system.<br /> <br /> And you've updated the doc, back to reading.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}